GROWER\nPhenoFarm\nRecords only \u2014 verification, quotes, status\nBOTH SIDES SYNC THE SAME REQUEST RECORD\nGrower\nSells wholesale\nFlat software subscription. On $1M of wholesale volume, PhenoFarm costs the same as on $10k \u2014 $0 of it is ours.\n\nPLATFORM TOUR\n\nEverything between discovery and delivery\n\nFive systems working as one workspace. The tour plays itself \u2014 or click any step.\n\nLicense verification that gates ordering\n\nAdmins review every license before a buyer can order. Trust is enforced, not implied.\n\nNative quote negotiation\nLive request lifecycle\nCompliance-grade catalog\nOperational analytics\nGreen Mountain Dispensary\nVT-RTL-2024-001 \u00b7 expires 12/2027\nLicense verified\nIDENTITY\nCleared\nLICENSE\nCleared\nORDERING\nCleared\n\nUnverified buyers physically cannot submit a request \u2014 the gate is enforced in the order pipeline, not on a badge.\n\nTWO SIDES, ONE WORKFLOW\n\nBuilt for both ends of the deal\n\nGrowers and dispensaries work from the same shared record \u2014 no forwarded PDFs, no version drift.\n\nFor growers\nFor dispensaries\n01\nPublish your catalog\n\nStrains, batches, COAs, stock. Show prices openly or quote on request.\n\n02\nField requests & quotes\n\nVerified dispensaries submit requests; negotiate terms in a recorded thread.\n\n03\nFulfill with shared status\n\nAccept, prepare, deliver \u2014 the buyer watches the same timeline you update.\n\n04\nInvoice on your terms\n\nSettle directly with the buyer. PhenoFarm keeps the record, never the money.\n\nOPERATORS\n\nTrusted where trust is the product\n\u201cThe verification gate changed how we onboard partners. If a buyer can submit a request, we already know their license cleared review.\u201d\nMJ\nMarcus Johnson\nFounder, Valley Green Farms\n\u201cQuotes, counters, and the final terms live in one thread. When a delivery lands, nobody argues about what was agreed.\u201d\nSC\nSarah Chen\nOwner, Green Mountain Dispensary\n\u201cSettlement staying direct was the deciding factor. PhenoFarm organizes the workflow without taking a position in the transaction.\u201d\nDK\nDavid Kim\nOperations Director, Elevate Wellness\n\nIllustrative customer scenarios.\n\nPRICING\n\nOne flat subscription. Zero take rate.\n\nCultivators pay for software, not per transaction. Wholesale value moves directly between businesses \u2014 PhenoFarm never touches it.\n\nMonthly\nAnnual \u00b7 save 20%\nFree\n\nEvaluate the marketplace workflow before enabling paid plans\n\n$0\n/mo\nDemo and review access\nCatalog and request workflow preview\nUp to 50 product listings\nBasic marketplace records\nStandard support\nCreate Account\nMOST POPULAR\nPro\n\nCultivator subscription for active wholesale teams\n\n$199\n/mo\nbilled $2388/yr\nEverything in Free\nUnlimited product listings\nPriority support & higher limits\nCSV bulk upload\nMetrc integration ready\nPriority support\nCreate Account\nBusiness\n\nFor multi-license operations that need deeper integrations\n\nCustom\nEverything in Pro\nAPI access\nCustom branding\nDedicated onboarding\nContact Sales\n\nFAQ\n\nStraight answers\nDoes PhenoFarm process our wholesale payments?\n\nNo \u2014 deliberately. Order value is tracked for your records only; invoicing and settlement happen directly between buyer and grower on whatever terms you agree. PhenoFarm charges cultivators a flat software subscription and takes 0% of wholesale value.\n\nHow does license verification work?\nWhat happens when a request is cancelled?\nCan we keep our prices private?\nIs PhenoFarm compliance-ready?\nHow do we evaluate it?\nRun wholesale like the rest of your business\n\nCatalog, verification, quotes, and fulfillment in one workspace \u2014 with settlement exactly where it belongs: between you and your partners.\n\nCreate your account\nTalk to us\nNo wholesale payment processing\nCultivator subscriptions only\nDemo access available\nPF\nPhenoFarm\n\nThe B2B workspace connecting licensed cannabis growers and dispensaries for